; Punch camera Y.

; @shakeStageCamera 0 force:2,-1.5,0 frequency:70 damp:1 !random time:5
; Punch camera XY.

; @shakeStageCamera 0 force:0.5,0,0 frequency:5 damp:2 random! time:0.5
; Shake camera X.

; @shakeStageCamera 0 force:0,1,0 frequency:12 damp:1.5 random! time:1
; Shake camera Y.

; @shakeStageCamera 0 force:2,-1.5,0 frequency:70 damp:1 random! time:5
; Shake camera XY.
